This is the Author's integration-verification record, not independent acceptance. Bound to tested/published HEAD `fee364c6d61a5feebf08dbdd830a5a57ee2d872b`, feature/test-merge tree `ace7e44cd89194d189a30a0aa6cf513a45b3b87c`, and actual CI test-merge `90e222635a01e89f095e9a256ac69ecfc759ec4e` (ordered parents frozen154 `91827360c185cbf813277bf32a6627d894b1b20a`, then feature HEAD). This comment archive makes the previously workspace-only final audit durable without any new commit, product/test/build input change, workflow dispatch or CI cycle.

Permanent run/job references: [Development40006927076](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/git-repo-db/actions/runs/40006927076), [Development indexed receipt / offline job120597093781](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/git-repo-db/actions/runs/40006927076/job/120597093781), [Access40006927148 and indexed receipt / job120597093978](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/git-repo-db/actions/runs/40006927148/job/120597093978), [Pages40006927071](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/git-repo-db/actions/runs/40006927071). All terminal: Development/Pages success; Access failure.

The complete raw final receipt ZIPs are referenced by these verified job records, not embedded in comments. Actions logs/artifacts remain subject to GitHub retention/access; durable comments below retain the report, measured binding/results, complete indexed member sizes/SHA256, and exact verifier. Initial full artifact download was Azure Forbidden/zero bytes; final binary downloads were not attempted. No new download success or denial is claimed. Actual hosted overflow remains unexecuted. All493 execution/distribution inputs match the tested source; [committed input-invariance evidence](https://github.com/TakashiSasaki/git-repo-db/blob/fee364c6d61a5feebf08dbdd830a5a57ee2d872b/docs/implementation/evidence/adr0031-i6b-sdist-c0-integration-20261024/PUBLICATION-INPUT-INVARIANCE.json).

The following REPORT bytes are preserved exactly inside the fence. Its closing statement that the audit was external describes the original audit time; this archive now publishes that report and essential evidence. The external106-payload index is metadata for that audit, not a claim that all raw106 payloads are embedded here.

